{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Action and Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique action shooter where close-quarters brawls and precision gunfights intertwine, delivering a fresh and electrifying PvP experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/3a647f0269f9431b34795d3de66e5828.poster.avif?t=1770356576\" width=700 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/3a647f0269f9431b34795d3de66e5828.webm?t=1770356576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/3a647f0269f9431b34795d3de66e5828.mp4?t=1770356576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>diverse battle modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the full spectrum of battle modes \u2014 from strategic 6v6 and intense 3v3 skirmishes to 1v1 duels and chaotic Free-For-Alls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode delivers its own rhythm of action and competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/7090ab3815de5978cea3f4e42d91b5b1.poster.avif?t=1770356576\" width=700 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/7090ab3815de5978cea3f4e42d91b5b1.webm?t=1770356576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/7090ab3815de5978cea3f4e42d91b5b1.mp4?t=1770356576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Define your identity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your style through diverse Masters, unique costumes, and customizable weapon parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your individuality on the battlefield with looks that stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/f538e608edff542e986292e6faa2af89.poster.avif?t=1770356576\" width=700 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/f538e608edff542e986292e6faa2af89.webm?t=1770356576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/f538e608edff542e986292e6faa2af89.mp4?t=1770356576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrilling Skills, Diverse Combat Styles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of diverse combat styles \u2014 strike, infiltrate, disrupt, or engage from afar with unique skill sets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/80c598b96d2ae0a9bf9b7344a175da33.poster.avif?t=1770356576\" width=700 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/80c598b96d2ae0a9bf9b7344a175da33.webm?t=1770356576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1277530/extras/80c598b96d2ae0a9bf9b7344a175da33.mp4?t=1770356576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shooting Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1277530/3e9371d252484fd32de6840c471de958d915e561.jpg"},{"name":"Head Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcom